{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgfBwQxZYmid8uZJAt4dR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both fixes are in, and the bundled HTML is rebuilt.\n\n- **About screen:** it now shows the full Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback answers in place of the pointer lines. Each answer is generated from `exit-interview.json` at build time, so the two can't drift apart. I checked it in the browser and it scrolls (S key) to the feedback sections.\n- **Settings:** the Settings page does contain Button symbols (PlayStation/Xbox), Invert stick left and right, and Invert stick up and down, as the page text confirms. The Xbox and stick-inversion behaviour was already checked earlier in the browser and in the tests.\n- **Phone-width title:** on screens narrower than 380 px the title now sits lower and smaller, clear of the menu buttons. I didn't re-screenshot a phone after this change, so that one is unconfirmed.\n\nAfter the change the systems tests still pass (73 of 73). I didn't re-run the attract-mode and AI Hub test files after this change.\n\nThe Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections in my previous reply still stand unchanged."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1839,"cache_read_input_tokens":331033,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1839,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":380,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"93b63dd9-a1ff-4df8-b77f-2b0e19e5047c","uuid":"2c112a52-ebbe-40bf-a31c-41255fee262f","timestamp":"2026-11-03T02:15:57.600Z","request_id":"req_011CgfBwQaEtRMtY5LeeZVW3"}
